[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はーっ！\nやっぱ、フロッケの作るメシはうめぇな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haaah!\nMan, Flocke's cooking is the best!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マクダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへ、ありがとうございます。\nたくさんあるので、いっぱい食べてくださいね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, thank you!\nThere's plenty more, so please eat up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すみません、急に押しかけてしまって。\n皆さんも大変な思いをしているはずなのに……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry for barging in like this.\nI know you all must be going through a lot..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんな気を遣わなくていいよ。あんまり\n落ち込んでばかりもいられないっていうか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry about it. Besides, we can't just sit around\nfeeling down all the time..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "信じて待つって決めたからさ。\nそんで相棒が起きた時、笑顔で迎えてやるんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've chosen to believe.\nAnd when Valeria wakes up, we'll greet her with smiles."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そうですか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I see."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "フロッケたちで力になれることなら、\nなんでも仰ってくださいね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If there's anything we can do to help,\njust say the word!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おう、遠慮せず食ってけよ。考えるにも力がいるだろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, don't hold back. You need energy to think, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はいっ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ランツェさんのお鍋も、とっても美味しいです。\n魚介の旨味が、ぎゅっと詰まってますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze's hot pot is delicious too.\nAll the seafood flavors are perfectly concentrated!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へへっ、だろ？\nこの鍋は、ヴァレリアも気に入ってんだぜ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heh, damn right!\nEven Valeria can't get enough of this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この鍋はじゃなくて、この鍋もでしょ？\n相棒が気に入らない料理なんてないよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not just this hot pot—she loves all your cooking!\nThere isn't a dish Valeria doesn't like."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういやあいつ、山に生えてるキノコとか\nそのままムシって食ってやがったよな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Speaking of which, didn't she used to just pick\nmushrooms off the mountain and eat 'em raw?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マクダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうそう！\u3000お腹が空けば\nなんでも口に入れちゃうような奴だからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right! When she's hungry,\nshe'll put pretty much anything in her mouth!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今まで、毒に当たらなかったのが\n不思議なぐらいだよなぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's a miracle she never got poisoned\nall this time..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えええ！\u3000止めてあげてください！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eeeh! Someone should have stopped her!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアはすごく強いから、\nお腹の中も強いんじゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria's so strong, so\nI guess it makes sense her stomach can handle anything too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははっ！\u3000それは言えてんな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha! You got that right!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マクダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しっかし、あいつの話をすると\n食いもんのことばっかになるよなぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y'know, whenever we talk about her,\nit always comes back to food..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、そんなことないでしょ。\n他にも色んなことあったじゃん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No way, that's not true.\nWe've had lots of other moments!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たとえば？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Like what?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ダメだ。\n美味しそうに食べてる顔しか思い出せない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Darn.\nI can only picture her happy face while eating."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もうっ！\u3000ハイディさんってば！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geez! Heidi!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（笑い声）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*laughs*"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
