    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（笑い声）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*laughs*"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（笑い声）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*laughs*"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（みんなにとってのヴァレリアは、\n\u3000強くて食べることが好きな、大事な家族なんだ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(To everyone, Valeria is a precious family member—\nstrong and always eager to eat.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私から見たヴァレリアはどんな人だった？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But I never took the time to see that side of her.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（そうだ。悲しくて苦しくて、助けることばかりに\n\u3000躍起になっていた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I was too overwhelmed by grief and desperation,\nthinking only about how to save her...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、どうかした？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna? Something wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、その……ヴァレリアのことを考えていました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, um... I was just thinking about Valeria."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私にとってヴァレリアってどんな人だったかなって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "About what kind of person she was to me..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前もあいつとは長い間一緒だったんだ。\n難しいこと考えなくてもいいんじゃねえか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You've been with her for a long time too.\nDon't overthink it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "素直に思ったままが答えだろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just go with what your heart tells you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "思ったままが、答え……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What my heart tells me..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういや、お前とヴァレリアが初めて会った時の\n話って聞いたことなかったよな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come to think of it, we've never heard the story\nof how you two first met."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マクダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "聞かせてくれよ。\nお前から見たヴァレリアって、どんな奴だった？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tell us about it.\nWhat was Valeria like when you first saw her?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マクダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっと、私が初めてヴァレリアに会ったのは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I first met Valeria..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]